DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
5792::$$$message_0040_0000_0000$$$::"Uuugh... Aaah... Aoooahn."[lr]::
5793::$$$message_0040_0000_0001$$$::I hear silly roaring.[lr]::
5794::$$$message_0040_0000_0002$$$::Is it coming from the living room?[lr]::
5795::$$$message_0040_0000_0003$$$::"This voice is Fuji-nee, right... What is she doing?"[lr]::
5796::$$$message_0040_0000_0004$$$::Girls shouldn't make strange noises in broad daylight.[lr]::
5797::$$$message_0040_0000_0005$$$::...Fuji-nee isn't a girl anymore, though.::
5798::$$$message_0040_0001_0000$$$::"She's losing the delicacy of her youth..."[lr]::
5799::$$$message_0040_0001_0001$$$::[movefg opacity=255 left=390 top=17 time=800 accel=0 storage=凛私服04a(近) textoff=0]The key to not mentally aging is to never gather in groups of three or more, according to Tohsaka.[wm canskip=0][lr]::
5800::$$$message_0040_0001_0002$$$::[movefg opacity=255 pos=c time=1200 accel=-2 storage=藤05a(中) textoff=0][movefg opacity=0 left=56 top=17 time=800 accel=0 storage=凛私服04a(近) textoff=0]But Fuji-nee's growing up well enough on her own, all right...[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
5801::$$$message_0040_0001_0003$$$::And she just happens to be in the living room...with Sakura?::
5802::$$$message_0040_0002_0000$$$::"Ah, Senpai."[lr]::
5803::$$$message_0040_0002_0001$$$::"It's Shirou! That feels purrfect, rawr."[lr]::
5804::$$$message_0040_0002_0002$$$::"Are you a cat or a tiger? Make up your mind."[lr]::
5805::$$$message_0040_0002_0003$$$::The beast purrs and stretches.[lr]::
5806::$$$message_0040_0002_0004$$$::It looks like Sakura is...giving her a shoulder massage?::
5807::$$$message_0040_0003_0000$$$::"Um... Ms. Fujimura said she was tired, so I'm giving her a massage."[lr]::
5808::$$$message_0040_0003_0001$$$::"You're such a nice girl, Sakura. So thoughtful. I wish I had a little sister like you!"[lr]::
5809::$$$message_0040_0003_0002$$$::...It must feel really good, because she's let herself go.[lr]::
5810::$$$message_0040_0003_0003$$$::I hope she melts down along with her stripes and turns into a puddle of butter.::
5811::$$$message_0040_0004_0000$$$::"Really? But I'm so clumsy..."[lr]::
5812::$$$message_0040_0004_0001$$$::"Because a little brother Shirou would be too selfish to rub my shoulders."[lr]::
5813::$$$message_0040_0004_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服07d(中) textoff=0]That is a misrepresentation of the facts, Fuji-nee.[lr]::
5814::$$$message_0040_0004_0003$$$::She's forgotten all the things she's made me do.[lr]::
5815::$$$message_0040_0004_0004$$$::"You used to make me give you massages all the time."::
5816::$$$message_0040_0005_0000$$$::"...Did I?"[lr]::
5817::$$$message_0040_0005_0001$$$::"Yeah. I practiced all my shoulder massage skills on you."[lr]::
5818::$$$message_0040_0005_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服07b(中) textoff=0]She was always reluctant to let Kiritsugu do it. She might have naturally stiff joints.[lr]::
5819::$$$message_0040_0005_0003$$$::So, Fuji-nee would complain about her sore shoulders, and a struggle for life and death broke out, ending with me giving her massages.::
5820::$$$message_0040_0006_0000$$$::"You gave Ms. Fujimura massages too, Senpai?"[lr]::
5821::$$$message_0040_0006_0001$$$::"Just when he was finally getting strong enough to really work the kinks out of my lower shoulders...[cacheimage storage=藤10b(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=藤10b(中) time=300 textoff=0] I'm so sad!"[lr]::
5822::$$$message_0040_0006_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服10b(中)]Sakura nods along to the story.[lr]::
5823::$$$message_0040_0006_0003$$$::...I didn't grow up so I could be her masseuse, you know.::
5824::$$$message_0040_0007_0000$$$::"I see... You were a good brother."[lr]::
5825::$$$message_0040_0007_0001$$$::"Yeah. I hated it at the time, but I got serious about it once I started."[lr]::
5826::$$$message_0040_0007_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服07c(中) textoff=0]Once I started the task, I'd go all the way until Fuji-nee said it was enough.[lr]::
5827::$$$message_0040_0007_0003$$$::I won't mention the times I embarrassed myself by getting exhausted halfway.::
5828::$$$message_0040_0008_0000$$$::"Yeah, Shirou, how long has it been since you gave me a massage like this?"[lr]::
5829::$$$message_0040_0008_0001$$$::"...I don't remember."[lr]::
5830::$$$message_0040_0008_0002$$$::"I can't ask my brother or any of the others for massages. I'm so stiff recently."[lr]::
5831::$$$message_0040_0008_0003$$$::"Really... [cacheimage storage=桜私服04a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜私服04a(中) time=300 textoff=0]Oh, you have a knot here.::
5832::$$$message_0040_0009_0000$$$::"Aaah, there, [cacheimage storage=藤06b頬(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=藤06b頬(中) textoff=0]fnyaaah, aaaah...[cacheimage storage=藤06a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=藤06a(中) textoff=0] Aaahhh!"[lr]::
5833::$$$message_0040_0009_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服06c(中) textoff=0]Fuji-nee gradually goes more and more slack.[lr]::
5834::$$$message_0040_0009_0002$$$::...There's absolutely nothing lewd about this, but somehow, just watching it makes me feel dirty.::
5835::$$$message_0040_0010_0000$$$::"You really worked hard today, Ms. Fujimura."[lr]::
5836::$$$message_0040_0010_0001$$$::"Well, sacred professions are tiring, after all. [cacheimage storage=藤09a腕b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤09a腕b(中) textoff=0]Despite appearances, I'm a proper teacher!"[lr]::
5837::$$$message_0040_0010_0002$$$::"You're always a proper teacher, Ms. Fujimura.[lr]::
5838::$$$message_0040_0010_0003$$$::And I'm happy I could help you."[lr]::
5839::$$$message_0040_0010_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=藤01c(中),桜私服01c(中) textoff=0]Sakura happily rubs her shoulders.::
5840::$$$message_0040_0011_0000$$$::"Mm, you have good technique, Sakura."[lr]::
5841::$$$message_0040_0011_0001$$$::"Not really."[lr]::
5842::$$$message_0040_0011_0002$$$::"No, I can tell. No shoulder massage virgin could make it feel this good!"[lr]::
5843::$$$message_0040_0011_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服01a頬(中) textoff=0]What kind of cringe-worthy new vocabulary is that?::
5844::$$$message_0040_0012_0000$$$::"Mm, hm hm hm."[lr]::
5845::$$$message_0040_0012_0001$$$::"...Ms. Fujimura?"[lr]::
5846::$$$message_0040_0012_0002$$$::"I know, you always give Shirou massages, right?"::
5847::$$$message_0040_0013_0000$$$::W-what is this stupid tiger making up now!?[lr]::
5848::$$$message_0040_0013_0001$$$::Sakura wouldn't...for me...::
5849::$$$message_0040_0014_0000$$$::"Uh, n-no, I don't!"[lr]::
5850::$$$message_0040_0014_0001$$$::"I can definitely see it. Sakura being nice and giving you massages every night. [cacheimage storage=藤06a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤06a(中) textoff=0]That must be why you're so good at this!"[lr]::
5851::$$$message_0040_0014_0002$$$::"F-[wvl][shock vmax=30 time=300 count=-4]Fuji-nee!"::
5852::$$$message_0040_0015_0000$$$::"Why are you blushing so much? Do you want Sakura to give you a full-body massage, too?"[lr]::
5853::$$$message_0040_0015_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服10e頬(中) textoff=0]She chuckles in a catlike manner.[lr]::
5854::$$$message_0040_0015_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服12a頬(中) textoff=0]If Sakura gives me a massage...I'd get so nervous that it'd make my muscles even more tense![lr]::
5855::$$$message_0040_0015_0003$$$::"R-right, Sakura?"::
5856::$$$message_0040_0016_0000$$$::"There's no hiding it from your big sister... [cacheimage storage=桜私服16a頬(近),藤03a(近)b,i衛宮邸居間(fd)][wvl][play storage=bgm143.ogg][se storage=se151.wav][rep fliplr=0 storages=桜私服16a頬(近),藤03a(近)b time=200 flipudr=0 poss=r,c bg=i衛宮邸居間(fd) indexes=1000,2000 textoff=0][quake vmax=30 hmax=10 time=800]Hurgh!"[lr]::
5857::$$$message_0040_0016_0001$$$::What just happened? Sakura got all red?[lr]::
5858::$$$message_0040_0016_0002$$$::"[chgfg time=200 storage=藤02d腕c(近) textoff=0][move time=50 path=(123,5,255)(128,6,255)(142,1,255)(133,2,255)(133,12,255)(129,1,255)(126,7,255)(140,10,255)(133,10,255)(133,3,255)(128,10,255)(129,4,255)(132,4,255)(132,11,255)(126,2,255)(126,4,255)(126,9,255)(139,4,255)(137,9,255)(131,1,255)(131,5,255)(138,3,255)(135,7,255)(130,4,255)(130,9,255)(127,1,255) storage=藤02d腕c(近) accel=0 textoff=0]Ow ow ow, not there, Sakura!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
5859::$$$message_0040_0016_0003$$$::"S-senpai and I wouldn't do anything that dirty!"[lr]::
5860::$$$message_0040_0016_0004$$$::"[chgfg time=200 storage=藤03a頬(近)b textoff=0]Ah, [cacheimage storage=藤08d頬(近)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=200 storage=藤08d頬(近) textoff=0]S-[cacheimage storage=藤02d頬腕b(近)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=200 storage=藤02d頬腕b(近) textoff=0]Sakura, not there. [cacheimage storage=藤03a頬(近)b][wvl canskip=false time=200][chgfg time=200 storage=藤03a頬(近)b textoff=0]You're pressing my acupressure points really hard!"[lr]::
5861::$$$message_0040_0016_0005$$$::"I said it's not like that, [cacheimage storage=桜私服13h(近)][wvl][se storage=se290.wav][se storage=se284.wav][quake vmax=40 hmax=10 time=400][chgfg time=200 storage=桜私服13h(近) textoff=0]I would never massage every inch of Senpai's body!"::
5862::$$$message_0040_0017_0000$$$::"OW, ow ow ow ow ow ow, that hurt!"[lr]::
5863::$$$message_0040_0017_0001$$$::Fuji-nee lets out an uncharacteristic shriek.[wm canskip=0][lr]::
5864::$$$message_0040_0017_0002$$$::[move time=80 path=(-171,0,255)(-160,33,255)(-128,0,255)(-159,0,255) storage=藤03a頬(近)b accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0]Did Sakura panic and poke her too hard somewhere?[wm canskip=0]::
5865::$$$message_0040_0018_0000$$$::"Hrrrrgh, are you trying to kill me, Sakura!?"[lr]::
5866::$$$message_0040_0018_0001$$$::"S-say something, Senpai!"[lr]::
5867::$$$message_0040_0018_0002$$$::"Me!?"[lr]::
5868::$$$message_0040_0018_0003$$$::...This is no time to be spacing out and admiring her massage skills.::
5869::$$$message_0040_0019_0000$$$::"I think a massage from you would feel good."[lr]::
5870::$$$message_0040_0019_0001$$$::"Huh? Ah..."[lr]::
5871::$$$message_0040_0019_0002$$$::"See, he even wants one! [cacheimage storage=藤03a頬(近)b,桜私服03c(近)][wvl canskip=false time=600][se storage=se152.wav][se storage=se138.wav][shock vmax=33 time=400 count=-3][chgfg time=200 storage=藤03a頬(近)b,桜私服03c(近) pos=c,r textoff=0][se storage=se151.wav]Blargh!"[se storage=se050.wav][lr]::
5872::$$$message_0040_0019_0003$$$::[clfg time=600 pos=all textoff=0]Fuji-nee earns herself another powerful squeeze.[lr]::
5873::$$$message_0040_0019_0004$$$::...This is terrifying. I wonder if Sakura's mastered some weird kung fu like Tohsaka did.::
5874::$$$message_0040_0020_0000$$$::"Ow, [cacheimage storage=藤07a頬腕a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=藤07a頬腕a(中) textoff=0]ow ow ow, [wvl][se storage=se151.wav][shock vmax=30 time=300 count=-3]argh!"[cacheimage storage=藤07a腕b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=藤07a腕b(中) pos=c textoff=0][lr]::
5875::$$$message_0040_0020_0001$$$::"Sakura, don't go overboard... We can't have you killing her."[lr]::
5876::$$$message_0040_0020_0002$$$::"Huh...? [cacheimage storage=桜私服03e(中)][wvl canskip=false time=500][chgfg storage=桜私服03e(中) pos=rc time=300 textoff=0]Oh, I'm sorry.[lr]::
5877::$$$message_0040_0020_0003$$$::I used a little too much strength."[lr]::
5878::$$$message_0040_0020_0004$$$::[move opacity=255 base=藤07a頬腕b(中) cx=259 layer=2 py=321 px=431 affine=(344,339,4.086,1,255,259,279)(291,331,2.203,1,255,258,278)(188,395,8.616,1,0,314,322)(112,434,12.724,1,0,259,279) time=1200 cy=279 mag=1 deg=+0.0 accel=2 spline=1 textoff=0]So she says, but Fuji-nee won't be moving for a while.[wm canskip=0][lr]::
5879::$$$message_0040_0020_0005$$$::[chgfg storage=桜私服08l(中) pos=rc time=300 textoff=0]...I see. I've learned a few things not to say when Sakura's giving me a massage.::
5880::$$$message_0040_0021_0000$$$::"...Kuh, to think you even knew these techniques... I  underestimated you."[lr]::
5881::$$$message_0040_0021_0001$$$::"Are you all right? Should we keep going?"[lr]::
5882::$$$message_0040_0021_0002$$$::"Ah, that was a good one today. Foot massages don't work unless they also make your feet hurt."[cacheimage storage=桜私服07c(中)][wvs][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服07c(中) textoff=0][lr]::
5883::$$$message_0040_0021_0003$$$::Fuji-nee cracks her neck from side to side and stands up.::
5884::$$$message_0040_0022_0000$$$::"Thanks, Sakura. I feel a lot better."[lr]::
5885::$$$message_0040_0022_0001$$$::"You're quite welcome."[lr]::
5886::$$$message_0040_0022_0002$$$::"Next time, let's make every nook and cranny of Shirou soft[line len=2]"::
5887::$$$message_0040_0023_0000$$$::"Ahh, n-not that again! I'm weak there!"[lr]::
5888::$$$message_0040_0023_0001$$$::"How many times do I have to say it!? Senpai and I aren't...!"[lr]::
5889::$$$message_0040_0023_0002$$$::"Guargh! What terrible finger pressure! This tiger is preparing for death ...!"::
5890::$$$message_0040_0024_0000$$$::Fuji-nee collapses to the ground with a strange smile. I can't tell if she's happy or in pain.[lr]::
5891::$$$message_0040_0024_0001$$$::It's a tranquil death that could send her to the Land of Buddha or even Nirvana.::
5892::$$$message_0040_0025_0000$$$::"...Don't go too hard on her, Sakura.[lr]::
5893::$$$message_0040_0025_0001$$$::I'm going to go make dinner."[lr]::
5894::$$$message_0040_0025_0002$$$::"Yes, Senpai![lr]::
5895::$$$message_0040_0025_0003$$$::[line len=3][chgfg storage=桜私服06c(中) pos=rc time=300 textoff=0]Hehehe, Ms. Fujimura? I'll take good care of you."[lr]::
5896::$$$message_0040_0025_0004$$$::"Eeek! Damn, Sakura! You scary!"::
905862::$$$message_9040_0017_0000$$$::"OW, ow ow ow ow ow ow, that hurt!"[r]::

